                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <strong>Unlimited Users & Workspaces</strong></li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> <strong>All 37 Features + Custom Modules</strong></li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Single Sign-On (SAML / Okta / Azure AD)</li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Unlimited Cloud Document Storage</li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Dedicated Technical Account Manager</li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> Custom REST APIs & Real-time Webhooks</li>
                            <li><svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg> 99.99% Enterprise SLA with 24/7 Phone Support</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Value Assurance / Guarantees -->
    <section class="oz-pricing-guarantees">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="oz-pricing-guarantees-grid">
                <div class="oz-guarantee-item">
                    <div class="oz-guarantee-icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>14-Day Free Trial</h4>
                    <p>Test drive all 33 features immediately. No credit card required to get started.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="oz-guarantee-item">
                    <div class="oz-guarantee-icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>100% Data Ownership</h4>
                    <p>Your organisation's data is strictly yours. Export all member, finance, and rota records anytime in 1 click.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="oz-guarantee-item">
                    <div class="oz-guarantee-icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4>No Hidden Fees</h4>
                    <p>Predictable monthly or annual pricing. Never worry about sudden surge bills as your staff roster scales.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="oz-guarantee-item">
                    <div class="oz-guarantee-icon">
                        <svg width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
                    </div>
