                    <p>Registered charities, schools, and non-profits qualify for an additional 15% discount on all plans.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ Accordion -->
    <section class="oz-pricing-faq">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="oz-pricing-faq-header">
                <span class="design-mark"></span>
                <h2 class="oz-pricing-faq-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <p class="oz-pricing-faq-desc">Everything you need to know about our plans, billing, and trial setup.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="oz-pricing-faq-list">
                <details class="oz-faq-item" open>
                    <summary class="oz-faq-question">
                        <span>How does the 14-day free trial work?</span>
                        <svg class="oz-faq-arrow" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="oz-faq-answer">
                        <p>You can sign up and immediately access the full Ozikol suite without entering any credit card details. At the end of your 14 days, you can choose the plan that best fits your organisation's scale, or your workspace will gracefully pause with all your data preserved.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="oz-faq-item">
                    <summary class="oz-faq-question">
                        <span>Can I change or cancel my plan at any time?</span>
                        <svg class="oz-faq-arrow" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="oz-faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel your subscription directly from your billing settings at any time. If you cancel, your access continues until the end of your prepaid billing period.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="oz-faq-item">
                    <summary class="oz-faq-question">
                        <span>How does BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) for AI work?</span>
                        <svg class="oz-faq-arrow" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="oz-faq-answer">
                        <p>Ozikol gives you total control over AI costs. Rather than paying 5x token markups, you can paste your own OpenAI, Google Gemini, or Anthropic Claude API key. Your team uses AI assistants directly inside your workflows at direct provider pricing.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="oz-faq-item">
                    <summary class="oz-faq-question">
                        <span>What payment methods do you accept?</span>
                        <svg class="oz-faq-arrow" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="oz-faq-answer">
                        <p>We accept all major credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard, American Express) via Stripe. For Annual Professional and Enterprise subscriptions, we also support automated direct debit (BACS / SEPA) and corporate invoice bank transfers.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>

                <details class="oz-faq-item">
                    <summary class="oz-faq-question">
                        <span>Are the mobile apps included in the subscription?</span>
                        <svg class="oz-faq-arrow" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
                    </summary>
                    <div class="oz-faq-answer">
                        <p>Yes! Both the Android and iOS apps, as well as the mobile web portal (PWA), are included in all active plans. Your staff and members can download the app from Google Play or the App Store and log in using your organisation code at no extra charge.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom CTA Banner -->
    <section class="oz-pricing-cta-banner">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="oz-pricing-cta-box">
                <h2>Ready to transform the way your organisation runs?</h2>
                <p>Join over 160,000+ organisations worldwide. Start your 14-day free trial today.</p>
                <div class="oz-pricing-cta-actions">
                    <a href="/get-started" class="oz-pricing-btn oz-pricing-btn--primary">Get Started Free</a>
                    <a href="/support-hub/contact-sales" class="oz-pricing-btn oz-pricing-btn--white">Book a 1-on-1 Demo</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

<!-- Interactive Billing Toggle Script -->
<script>
    (function () {
        var toggle = document.getElementById('billingToggle');
        var labelMonthly = document.getElementById('labelMonthly');
        var labelAnnual = document.getElementById('labelAnnual');
        var amounts = document.querySelectorAll('.oz-pricing-amount');
        var notes = document.querySelectorAll('.oz-pricing-billed-note');
        var isAnnual = false;

        if (!toggle) return;

        function updatePricing() {
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked', isAnnual);
            toggle.classList.toggle('is-annual', isAnnual);
            labelMonthly.classList.toggle('is-active', !isAnnual);
            labelAnnual.classList.toggle('is-active', isAnnual);

            amounts.forEach(function (el) {
                var val = isAnnual ? el.getAttribute('data-annual') : el.getAttribute('data-monthly');
                el.textContent = val;
            });

            notes.forEach(function (el) {
                var text = isAnnual ? el.getAttribute('data-annual') : el.getAttribute('data-monthly');
                el.textContent = text;
            });
        }

        toggle.addEventListener('click', function () {
            isAnnual = !isAnnual;
            updatePricing();
        });

        labelMonthly.addEventListener('click', function () {
            isAnnual = false;
            updatePricing();
        });

        labelAnnual.addEventListener('click', function () {
            isAnnual = true;
            updatePricing();
        });
    })();
</script>
